.TH NEO-DIALER 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-dialer \- phone app for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-dialer
.RB [ \-\-incall ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Dialer rebuilt in GTK 4: favorites, recents, contacts, the dialpad and the call log. It is D-Bus activatable as de.yesman.Dialer and opens tel: links. With \-\-incall it shows the in-call screen, as the call service starts it.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-dialer-calls(1), ModemManager(8)
